{"product_id":"ill-will","title":"Ill Will","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Heathcliff has left Wuthering Heights and is travelling across the moors to Liverpool in search of his past. Along the way, he saves Emily, the foul-mouthed daughter of a highwayman, from a whipping, and the pair journey on together. Roaming from graveyard to graveyeard, making a living from Emily's apparent ability to commune with the dead, the pair lie, cheat and scheme their way across the North of England, towards the terrible misdeeds and untold riches that will one day send Heathcliff home to Wuthering Heights.\" -- Provided by publisher. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 230  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Michael Stewart \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780008248161 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43520571146393,"sku":"14RC9780008248161","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/746919bf7569b7bb860ce92d1af0b314.jpg?v=1698142482","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/ill-will","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}